### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**
```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:AutonomousDrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:HeavyFog ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:Snowfall ;
    ex:hasRoadCondition ex:SlipperyRoad .

ex:EgoVehicle a ex:SnowplowTruck ;
    ex:hasAttachment ex:Snowplow ;
    ex:isFollowing ex:LeadVehicle ;
    ex:isDrivingOn ex:RoadSegment1 .

ex:LeadVehicle a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isOccludedBy ex:HeavyFog ;
    ex:isAheadOf ex:EgoVehicle .

ex:RoadSegment1 a ex:Road ;
    ex:hasMarkings ex:DoubleYellowLines ;
    ex:hasTrafficCones ex:TrafficCone1 ;
    ex:hasObstacle ex:ReducedVisibility .

ex:TrafficCone1 a ex:TrafficCone ;
    ex:isLocatedNear ex:RightSideOfRoad .

ex:HeavyFog a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:reducesVisibilityTo xsd:float "0.1" .

ex:Snowfall a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:causes ex:SlipperyRoad .
```

